    "intro_narrative": "You are Lead Detective Vance of the Cyber Crimes Division. After months of dead ends, you've finally tracked down the elusive 'Architect'—a mastermind behind a string of untraceable corporate embezzlements. You stand inside his dimly lit, abandoned safehouse. The room is a chaotic web of scattered documents, burnt hard drives, and strange, archaic computing machinery. The Architect has locked his master digital ledger inside a heavily fortified central server. Getting your hands on that ledger is the only way to put him behind bars for good. However, the system is designed to self-destruct if tampered with. To bypass the final lock, you will need to operate his specialized investigative tools, piece together forensic trails, and crack layered encryption systems. The local authorities will be here in an hour to sweep the building; you must secure the evidence before they contaminate the crime scene. The clock is ticking, Detective.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
